# Nar Shaddaa, Goto's yacht (TSL, 351NAR, 007EBO, 303NAR): Goto's talk to
# its end (the proximity alarm); Mira and T3-M4 on the yacht: the utility
# droid's Shutdown program, the Security Console's Count entered (2:
# DSimpson's) and its Overload downloaded, the floating mines and the
# droids beyond, the Command Console (the programs uploaded, the
# containment cells unlocked with the codes the droid by it carried, and
# shut down), T3-M4 through the cells' locked door to the damaged droid's
# turret codes, the turrets shut down (they turn on the droids), the
# audience chamber fought through and the Exile freed; the Auxiliary
# Console's power codes (the containment cells and the docking hatch seal
# to the secondary supply: the cloaking device is there already), the hub's
# Command Console's power system unlocked, Mira at the head for Goto's
# mines and the command centre's minefield, the mine codes from the droid
# that carried them, T3-M4 through the bridge's locked door, the Bridge
# Command Console (the minefield shut down, then the power: the cloaking
# device fails), the bounty hunters fought back to the Ebon Hawk; Mira's
# word of Zez-Kai Ell, G0-T0 joining aboard and back to Nar Shaddaa's safe
# house. Once the Exile is free, the yacht's side (DSimpson's): the audience
# chamber's two sentry droids scavenged for components ([Repair]), the lab
# station (a battle stimulant made of chemicals, Treat Injury), the damaged
# utility droid in the third cell's memory core: the Reset program
# ([Computer]), uploaded at the Command Console; T3-M4 through the left
# side's security doors (DC 28) to the maintenance bay, and the far rooms'
# plasteel cylinders searched (the locked ones picked), the bridge's last.
# Starts from Goto's yacht's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_yacht data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_goto.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Goto's Yacht" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Reset is not run: each of its systems' "Run program: Reset." undoes the
# shut-downs the yacht's way through made.
talk                 # Goto's talk, to the proximity alarm
use g0t0kevin        # the utility droid: Shutdown
talk
use MilLowPlstcCylin@1 # the container by it
say Attempt to enter the Count.
say =Enter 2.
say Download program
say Upgrade droid combat algorithms # T3-M4's own combat upgrade (DEX)
say Log out.
use gotoarmory@2     # the Security Console
talk
fight 30             # the floating mines
to Door@1
fight 30             # the droids beyond
to g0t0droid@32      # the droid holding the containment cells' codes
fight 20             # (out of the first fight's reach at T3's level)
use g0t0droid@32     # its remains: the codes
say Program Library.
say Upload programs.
say Return to main menu.
say Unlock Restricted System.
say Unlock Containment Cell System.
say Return to main menu.
say Systems Control.
say =Access Containment Cells.
say Run program: Shut down.
say Log out.
use M478Console@4    # the Command Console
talk
leader 8             # T3-M4 picks the cells' door (DC 28)
unlock Door@15
use g0t0droid@28     # the damaged droid in the second cell: the turret codes
talk
say Unlock Restricted System.
say Unlock Turret System.
say Return to main menu.
say Systems Control.
say =Access Turret Defense.
say =Run program: Shut Down.
say Log out.
use M478Console@4    # the turrets shut down: they target everything
talk
unlock Door@14       # on towards the audience chamber
fight 15             # the guard droids by it (not the ship's far rooms)
leader 8             # T3-M4 at the T section's security door
unlock Door@13
leader player
fight 15             # the audience chamber's turrets
to wp_pc_rescue2     # the Exile freed
fight 15
save nar_shaddaa_exile
say [Repair] Scavenge the droid for components. # the audience chamber's
say Leave the droid alone. # sentry droids, shut down (351drd: a_givecomp)
use g0t0droids@1
talk
say [Repair] Scavenge the droid for components.
say Leave the droid alone.
use g0t0droids@2
talk
say [Use the Lab Station now.] # the torture room's lab station
use MedBen           # (k_medstation: ShowChemicalUpgradeScreen)
talk
craft g_i_cmbtshot001 # a battle stimulant (chemicalcreate.2da, Treat Injury 12)
unlock MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@4 # beside it
use MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@4
say [Computer] Access droid's memory core. # the damaged utility droid in
use c_drdastro003    # the third cell: the Reset program (800_software44)
talk
say Program Library.
say Upload programs.
say Log out.
use M478Console@3    # the Command Console by the torture room
talk
leader 8             # T3-M4 through the left side's security doors (DC 28)
unlock SecDoor
unlock Door@9
leader player
use MilLowPlstcCylin@4 # the maintenance bay
unlock MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@2
use MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@2
use MilMidPlstcCylin@1
use MilHighPlstcCylin@2 # the far rooms by the docking bay
use MilLowPlstcCylin@2
unlock MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@1
use MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@1
use MilLowPlstcCylin@3
use MilMidPlstcCylin@2
unlock MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@3
use MilLowPlstcCylinLocked@3
say Acquire Power Distribution Access Code.
say Access Primary Power Supply System.
say Switch containment cells to secondary system.
say Switch cloaking device to secondary system.
say Switch docking hatch
say Return to main menu.
say Log out.
use gotoarmory@1     # the Auxiliary Console
talk
leader 8             # T3-M4 at the audience chamber's door
unlock Door@13
leader player
say Unlock Restricted System.
say Unlock Power Distribution System
say Log out.
use M478Console@2    # the power system unlocked
talk
fight 30
leader 7             # Mira at the head: Goto's mines do not see her
if 800DRO_Console_56=1 # not yet seen (the fight may chase the party into
to 351_Mine_Dlg      # 351_Mine_Dlg2, which plays it then; a_mine1 sets it
talk                 # to 0): Goto activates the mines
end
leader player        # the Exile leads the fight: the Sentinel's sixth
fight 30             # level's Force Immunity (stun) holds against the
                     # sentry droid's stun ray, which keeps Mira stunned
use g0t0droid@27     # the mine codes
leader 7
to 351_Hub_Dlg       # the command centre
talk
fight 30             # the droids behind the minefield
leader 8             # T3-M4 at the bridge's door
unlock Door@10
leader 7
fight 30
say Unlock Restricted System.
say Unlock Minefield System.
say Return to main menu.
say Systems Control.
say =Access Minefield.
say =Run program: Shut Down.
say Return to Systems Control.
say =Access Power Distribution.
say =Run program: Shut down.
say Log out.
use ComputerPanel@1  # the Bridge Command Console
talk
unlock MilHighPlstcCylin@1 # the bridge's cylinder: the Droid Controller's
use MilHighPlstcCylin@1 # access code
save nar_shaddaa_bridge
leader player
exit TO_003EBO       # the bounty hunters fought back to the Ebon Hawk
module 007ebo
talk                 # Mira's word of Zez-Kai Ell; G0-T0
talk
module 303nar        # the safe house
save nar_shaddaa_zez
